updated.xml">Codacy docs</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://docs.codacy.com/release-notes/cloud/cloud-2024-10/</guid> </item> <item> <title>Codacy release notes</title> <description>Index of release notes for Codacy Cloud and Codacy Self-hosted.</description><link>https://docs.codacy.com/release-notes/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 14:38:04 +0000</pubDate><source url="https://docs.codacy.com/feed_rss_updated.xml">Codacy docs</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://docs.codacy.com/release-notes/</guid> </item> <item> <title>Adding Oxlint as new supported tool – September 2026</title> <description>We&amp;#x27;re excited to announce support for Oxlint, a fast Rust-based linter for JavaScript and TypeScript from the Oxc project. With this addition, Codacy can now automatically analyze your JavaScript and TypeScript projects for correctness, style, and best-practice issues (among other categories), reporting them directly in your dashboard.</description><link>https://docs.codacy.com/release-notes/cloud/cloud-2026-09-adding-oxlint/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 14:38:04 +0000</pubDate><source url="https://docs.codacy.com/feed_rss_updated.xml">Codacy docs</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://docs.codacy.com/release-notes/cloud/cloud-2026-09-adding-oxlint/</guid> </item> <item> <title>Cloud August 2026</title> <description>Release notes for Codacy Cloud August 2026.</description><link>https://docs.codacy.com/release-notes/cloud/cloud-2026-08/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 13:26:47 +0000</pubDate><source url="https://docs.codacy.com/feed_rss_updated.xml">Codacy docs</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://docs.codacy.com/release-notes/cloud/cloud-2026-08/</guid> </item> <item> <title>Cloud July 2026</title> <description>Release notes for Codacy Cloud July 2026.</description><link>https://docs.codacy.com/release-notes/cloud/cloud-2026-07/</link> <pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 09:09:10 +0000</pubDate><source url="https://docs.codacy.com/feed_rss_updated.xml">Codacy docs</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://docs.codacy.com/release-notes/cloud/cloud-2026-07/</guid> </item> <item> <title>Support for Shellcheck configuration file - July, 2026</title> <description>We’ve upgraded how Shellcheck works on Codacy! While you previously had to configure Shellcheck analysis directly through the Codacy UI, you can now manage your settings using a configuration file.</description><link>https://docs.codacy.com/release-notes/cloud/cloud-2026-07-adding-shellcheck-config-file/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 29 Jul 2026 17:19:15 +0000</pubDate><source url="https://docs.codacy.com/feed_rss_updated.xml">Codacy docs</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://docs.codacy.com/release-notes/cloud/cloud-2026-07-adding-shellcheck-config-file/</guid> </item> <item> <title>Adding PHP CS Fixer as new supported tool – July 2026</title> <description>&lt;h1&gt;Adding PHP CS Fixer as new supported tool – July 2026&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h2&gt;PHP CS Fixer&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re excited to announce support for [PHP-CS-Fixer](https://github.com/PHP-CS-Fix...&lt;/p&gt;</description><link>https://docs.codacy.com/release-notes/cloud/cloud-2026-07-adding-phpcsfixer-checkov-config-files/</link> <pubDate>Mon, 27 Jul 2026 15:15:53 +0000</pubDate><source url="https://docs.codacy.com/feed_rss_updated.xml">Codacy docs</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://docs.codacy.com/release-notes/cloud/cloud-2026-07-adding-phpcsfixer-checkov-config-files/</guid> </item> <item> <title>PHP_CodeSniffer Upgrade and Legacy Package Deprecations – July 2026</title> <description>We are preparing to upgrade our PHP CodeSniffer tool to the latest version. This update will bring vital performance improvements, better syntax parsing, and support for the latest PHP features.</description><link>https://docs.codacy.com/release-notes/cloud/cloud-2026-07-remove-codesniffer-packages/</link> <pubDate>Fri, 10 Jul 2026 16:14:33 +0000</pubDate><source url="https://docs.codacy.com/feed_rss_updated.xml">Codacy docs</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://docs.codacy.com/release-notes/cloud/cloud-2026-07-remove-codesniffer-packages/</guid> </item> <item> <title>Cloud June 2026</title> <description>Release notes for Codacy Cloud June 2026.</description><link>https://docs.codacy.com/release-notes/cloud/cloud-2026-06/</link> <pubDate>Fri, 10 Jul 2026 08:51:01 +0000</pubDate><source url="https://docs.codacy.com/feed_rss_updated.xml">Codacy docs</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://docs.codacy.com/release-notes/cloud/cloud-2026-06/</guid> </item> <item> <title>Cloud May 2026</title> <description>Release notes for Codacy Cloud May 2026.</description><link>https://docs.codacy.com/release-notes/cloud/cloud-2026-05/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 11 Jun 2026 10:32:57 +0000</pubDate><source url="https://docs.codacy.com/feed_rss_updated.xml">Codacy docs</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://docs.codacy.com/release-notes/cloud/cloud-2026-05/</guid> </item> <item> <title>Cloud April 2026</title> <description>Release notes for Codacy Cloud April 2026.</description><link>https://docs.codacy.com/release-notes/cloud/cloud-2026-04/</link> <pubDate>Fri, 08 May 2026 17:11:14 +0000</pubDate><source url="https://docs.codacy.com/feed_rss_updated.xml">Codacy docs</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://docs.codacy.com/release-notes/cloud/cloud-2026-04/</guid> </item> <item> <title>Cloud March 2026</title> <description>Release notes for Codacy Cloud March 2026.</description><link>https://docs.codacy.com/release-notes/cloud/cloud-2026-03/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 15 Apr 2026 13:30:44 +0000</pubDate><source url="https://docs.codacy.com/feed_rss_updated.xml">Codacy docs</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://docs.codacy.com/release-notes/cloud/cloud-2026-03/</guid> </item> <item> <title>Cloud January 2023</title> <description>Release notes for Codacy Cloud January 2023.</description><link>https://docs.codacy.com/release-notes/cloud/cloud-2023-01/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 02 Apr 2026 14:05:52 +0000</pubDate